   "id": 0,
   "en": "{07 04 00}Whoa!{01 00 00 0f 00} Hold up!{01 00 00 14 00} Whatcha\ngot over there?\n{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00}?\n{07 15 00}Man, that burns my wick!\n{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00}!\n\n{07 00 00}All right, lookit.\nI'll pay ya {07 0b 00}{04 10 00} Bells\nfor it. Whaddaya say?{02 00 00 03 04}\nSure.\nTake a hike!",
   "et": "{07 04 00}Ohoo!{01 00 00 0f 00} Oot!{01 00 00 14 00} Mis sul\nseal on?\n{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00}?\n{07 15 00}Poiss, see ajab mu põlema!\n{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00}!\n\n{07 00 00}Hea küll, vaata.\nMaksan {07 0b 00}{04 10 00} kella\nselle eest. Mis ütled?{02 00 00 03 04}\nMuidugi.\nKao minema!"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 04 00}Wauggggh! {01 00 00 0f 00}Hey!{01 00 00 05 00}\nLook what you have!\n{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00}!\n{07 00 00}I{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0f 00}{07 06 00} I really {01 00 00 05 00}NEED that...\n\n\nSay, {04 1f 00},{01 00 00 14 00} whaddaya\nthink about, uh{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n\n...selling your\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 0f 00}\nto me for {07 0b 00}{04 10 00} Bells?{02 00 00 03 04}\nOK.\nIn your dreams!",
   "et": "{07 04 00}Vauggggh! {01 00 00 0f 00}Hei!{01 00 00 05 00}\nVaata, mis sul on!\n{0b 03 00}{04 1a 00}!\n{07 00 00}Ma{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0f 00}{07 06 00} Ma tõesti {01 00 00 05 00}VAJAN seda...\n\n\nKuule, {04 1f 00},{01 00 00 14 00} mida sa\narvad, ee{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}\n\n...müüa mulle oma\n{0b 02 00}{04 1a 00}{01 00 00 0f 00}\n{07 0b 00}{04 10 00} kella eest?{02 00 00 03 04}\nOlgu.\nSinu unistustes!"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{07 04 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Hey{01 07 00}!{01 00 00 0f 00}\n{07 16 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0f 00} Go figure.\n\n{07 15 00}You went and got yourself\n{04 1a 00}\nwithout telling me{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{07 00 00}{07 06 00}Well, you sell me yours for\n{04 10 00} Bells, and I won't\nhold it against you!{01 00 00 0f 00}\nYa got that?{02 00 00 03 04}\nUh, all right.\nYou're joking!",
   "et": "{07 04 00}{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Hei{01 07 00}!{01 00 00 0f 00}\n{07 16 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0f 00} No muidugi.\n\n{07 15 00}Sa hankisid endale\n{04 1a 00}\nmulle ütlemata{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{07 00 00}{07 06 00}Noh, müü mulle oma\n{04 10 00} kella eest, ja ma\nei pane seda sulle pahaks!{01 00 00 0f 00}\nSaid aru?{02 00 00 03 04}\nEe, hea küll.\nSa teed nalja!"
  },
