  {
   "id": 6,
   "en": "{07 16 00}Oh, I get it.{01 00 00 0f 00} You like to\n{04 22 00}, huh?{01 00 00 05 00}\n\nWell, I guess late is better\nthan never{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n\n{07 15 00}Fine, I'm through with\nyou!{01 00 00 14 00} Later, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 16 00}Oh, selge.{01 00 00 0f 00} Sulle meeldib\n{04 22 00}, mis?{01 00 00 05 00}\n\nNoh, hilja on vist parem\nkui mitte kunagi{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n\n{07 15 00}Hästi, mul on sinust\nkõrini!{01 00 00 14 00} Näeme, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 7,
   "en": "{07 15 00}So{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0f 00} {07 00 00}You want me to get\n{04 1a 00}\nfrom a friend or somethin'?\n{07 1b 00}Well it must be NICE, havin'\nfriends and stuff{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 15 00}Nii{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 0f 00} {07 00 00}Sa tahad, et ma\nsaaksin {04 1a 00}\nsõbralt või midagi?\n{07 1b 00}Noh, KENA vist on, kui on\nsõpru ja kraami{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.\n{01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 8,
   "en": "{07 03 00}Har har har, {01 00 00 0f 00}right{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 01 00}\n{07 15 00}Well, you just made #1 on\nmy angry list, with a star!",
